HISTORY the ithaperture in order j can be found as                              HISTORY follows:lambda=array[*,0,{j-min(orders)}*naps +                         HISTORY (i-1)],flux=array[*,1,{j-min(orders)}*naps +                            HISTORY (i-1)],uncertainty=array[*,2,{j-min(orders)}*naps +                     HISTORY (i-1)],flag=array[*,3,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)].The spectra         HISTORY in the file(s) spectra1022.fits,                                        HISTORY spectra1023.fits,spectra1024.fits, spectra1025.fits,                    HISTORY spectra1026.fits,spectra1027.fits, spectra1028.fits,                    HISTORY spectra1029.fits,spectra1030.fits, spectra1031.fits,                    HISTORY spectra1032.fits,spectra1033.fits, spectra1034.fits,                    HISTORY spectra1035.fits,spectra1036.fits, spectra1037.fits were                HISTORY combined using a robustweighted mean with a sigma threshold of          HISTORY 8.  Aperture 1modifications: The scale factors were determined          HISTORY using order 1and are: 1.010335016811289,                                HISTORY 0.9492107340730178,0.9930874271300736, 0.9218272948849491,              HISTORY 0.9300468176940382,0.9885351965315253, 0.975728641707654,               HISTORY 0.9748364789223939,1.0070094799518208, 0.9620545061076332,              HISTORY 1.051875616969182,1.106022362826651, 1.077798945037372,                 HISTORY 1.1429913251474741,1.2560251615997648, 1.3255995398856137.              END                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             